  "lines": [
   {
    "text": "海外の野良猫たち人懐こすぎた！",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/voice/out-v1/p1/01.wav",
    "tts_text": "海外の野良猫たち、ひとなつこすぎた！",
    "caption": "",
    "at": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "かわいいな、かわいいな",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_01.wav",
    "at": 75
   },
   {
    "text": "猫が多いです。かわいいでしょ",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_02.wav",
    "at": 150
   },
   {
    "text": "最近なんか、猫が増えたのか",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_03.wav",
    "at": 237
   },
   {
    "text": "キャバにゃん。俺のフルーツに…おい！",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_04.wav",
    "at": 311
   },
   {
    "text": "また、キャバクラ猫が来ました",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_05.wav",
    "at": 399
   },
   {
    "text": "ずっと寝てんねん",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_06.wav",
    "at": 481
   },
   {
    "text": "生意気、この猫",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_07.wav",
    "at": 507
   },
   {
    "text": "怒ってんのか？",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_08.wav",
    "at": 592
   },
   {
    "text": "怒られました",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_09.wav",
    "at": 621
   },
   {
    "text": "勝手に嫌われました",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_10.wav",
    "at": 660
   },
   {
    "text": "ラブブ、ラブブ、邪魔すんな。おいおい、何してんの？",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_11.wav",
    "at": 718
   },
   {
    "text": "配信しよう",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_12.wav",
    "at": 790
   },
   {
    "text": "頭撫でようとすると、撫でるなっていう顔してくる",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_13.wav",
    "at": 891
   },
   {
    "text": "寝てます。僕の膝の上で",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_14.wav",
    "at": 969
   },
   {
    "text": "何睨んでねん",
    "orig_voice": true,
    "file": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/cats/narr/orig_p1_15.wav",
    "at": 1029
   },
   {
